Z||000000||My7Fieros||12-24-2001||12:56 PM||||Well I was doing something that I rarely do; pondering what kind of mild mods to do on my Fiero (being sarcastic of course)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">.<BR>Anyway Ive always wondered this...could it be possible, or is there a way, to somehow put in headlights like on the c-4 model Vettes? You know, the kind that "roll all the way around"....thought may be pretty cool. Not for any other reason than that really. <BR>Another idea...for those of you w/ the LT1/SBC engines, especially in Formulas....remember in the late 80's the Fierobird Formula 350s? The even had the decal on the side (the same Formula decal as on Fieros) that said "Formula 350" instead of just "Formula"..that'd be pretty cool on a Fiero (provided, of course, that you actually had a 350 in it)...just a thought. Whadda ya think?<p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 12-24-2001).]||||reg||1
